<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia launches quick telecom services for firms.</title>
<headline>Tunisia launches quick telecom services for firms.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Tuesday launched a new quick telecommunications service targeting firms needs and problems.</p>
<p>Tunisia Telecom, the state-controlled telecommunications body, said the service will be running all-around-the-clock to set up urgent telephone, telex and mobile phone lines on a permanent or temporary basis and provide quick assistance.</p>
<p>The new service was inaugurated on Friday by Communications Minister Habib Ammar.</p>
